# meta: !!omap
# - {description: Unclassified source candidates; usable is a conservative photometry-quality flag.}
# - {flux_note: Signed observed ADU in unchanged binary apertures; no neighbour subtraction. Positive light is used only for quality ratios
#     and approximate shot noise.}
# - {input_catalogue_sha256: 5b011b380a16b8712cc124ef365be2122c9f3eed1f7cbf3f2d9d77912bc39da0}
# - {review: Pixel-based quality review; no profile fitting. Original quality columns remain historical; use usable and flags for current
#     selection.}
# - {snr_note: Independent-pixel RMS plus positive signal/GAIN; correlated noise is not calibrated.}
# - {limits: label area 0.03; label light 0.02; shared light 0.02; SNR 5.0; close distance 1.25; bridge SNR 3.0; pair peak SNR 5.0}
# - {magnitude_convention: MAGZPT - 2.5 log10(flux_ADU * GAIN / EXPTIME)}
# - {classification_note: Remaining includes uncertain sources; not confirmed galaxies.}
# - {error_note: 'Independent-pixel RMS variance + F_ADU/GAIN shot variance; no blank-aperture correction. First-order magnitude errors
#     include shared MAGZRR and are stored, not plotted.'}
# - {method: Neighbour-refined aperture flux with Simple Analysis calibration and uncertainties}
# - {flux_column: aperture_flux_adu}
# - {background_subtracted: true}
# - {flags: 16=detection quality rejection; see the original flags column. No old aperture flag bits are inferred.}
